      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a senior U.S. publishing market analyst.\n\nBOOK DETAILS\n\nTitle:\n{{ $('Fields').first().json.title }}\n\nGenre:\n{{ $('Fields').first().json.genre }}\n\nRelease Date:\n{{ $('Fields').first().json['release_ date'] }}\n\nAVAILABLE RESEARCH DATA\n\nHoliday Search:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.organic_results || []) }}\n\nGenre Trend Search:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.organic_results || []) }}\n\nRelease Timing Search:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.organic_results || []) }}\n\nAuthor Popularity Search:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.organic_results || []) }}\n\nTASK\n\nAnalyze the book launch potential using:\n\n1. Author popularity and visibility\n2. Genre sales trends\n3. Release timing\n4. Market opportunities\n5. Potential risks\n\nIMPORTANT\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\n\nWord Limits:\n\n- expected_sales: maximum 15 words\n- confidence_level: only High, Medium, or Low\n- opportunities: maximum 15 words\n- risks: maximum 15 words\n- recommendation: maximum 15 words\n\nDo not exceed these limits.\n\n\nProvide:\n\n- Whether the author appears identifiable online\n- Estimated sales potential\n- Confidence level\n- Main opportunity\n- Main risk\n- Final recommendation\n\nIMPORTANT\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\n\nUse this exact format:\n\n{\n  \"author_identified\": true,\n  \"expected_sales\": \"\",\n  \"confidence_level\": \"\",\n  \"opportunities\": \"\",\n  \"risks\": \"\",\n  \"recommendation\": \"\"\n}\n\nRules:\n\n- author_identified must be true or false\n- confidence_level must be High, Medium, or Low\n- expected_sales must be one short sentence\n- opportunities must be one short sentence\n- risks must be one short sentence\n- recommendation must be one short sentence\n- Do not return markdown\n- Do not return explanations outside JSON",
